      "short": "Recap",
      "chapter": "recap",
      "title": "Not so fast: recap",
      "body": [
        "<ul class=\"takeaways\"><li><b>Authn ≠ authz</b> → knowing who someone is doesn't say what they may do</li><li><b>Server-side, every request</b> → check ownership of the object; the UI proves nothing</li><li><b>RBAC + ABAC</b> → roles for broad access, attribute rules for the fine print</li><li><b>Central policy</b> → one source of rules, enforced by every service</li><li><b>Least privilege</b> → services get only the access their job needs</li></ul>"
      ],
